description:
This chic, modern and luxurious condo apartment makes you feel extremely comfortable with a high-level privacy in the best location of Berlin, only 5 minutes away from the Berlin Central Station.

The name of this designer building is "Kunstcampus", which means "art campus" not only because of its gallery styled floor interior and building design, but also the area of many museums in the neighbourhood.

There is a Concierge service in the lobby, which helps residents with their everyday life in many ways, plus the security alarm in the condo is directly connected to the concierge's desk.
In the rooms you may feel safe, cozy and totally home, which is fully furnished with designer furniture and an original WARENDORF / MIELE equipped kitchen.

5 min. walk to Central Station Berlin;
5 min. walk to Subway, Bus;
1 min. walk to river;
5 min. walk to CHARITE hospital;
15min. walk to Friedrichsstrasse;
15min. walk to Reichstag;
20min. walk to Brandenburger Tor;

It's the best location in center of Berlin. Not only you have the best access to the public transportation (because of the Berlin Central Station almost just in front of the door), or you can reach every single sightseeing just within a casual walk distance, but also it's a great waterfront place where you can enjoy your private time in a quiet environment.

There is 1 king-sized double bed and 1 sofa-bed in the apartment.

cleaning service possible

Not suitable for pets
No smoking
No parties or events
No noise after 10pm
